.TH IG 1 "2026-10-30" "installgate 0.1.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ig, installgate \- pre-install trust gate for pip and npm
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ig
[\fB\-\-no\fR]
[\fB\-\-json\fR]
[\fB\-y\fR]
.I command
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check one install command against registry metadata and a YAML policy.
Does not install the package. Does not run third-party code.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-no
Check only. Never run pip or npm.
.TP
.B \-\-json
Print a GateVerdict JSON document.
.TP
.B \-y, \-\-yes
On ALLOW, run the pinned install without a prompt.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the package version and exit.
.TP
.B completion \fIshell\fR
Print a completion script for bash, zsh, or fish.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 ALLOW, 1 REVIEW, 2 BLOCK.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/Seavleu/installgate
